# NestedText v3 — polyglot guide + greek numbers (expanded skeleton)
# Sources: DTD_GUIDE_PROMPT_POLYGLOT_EXAMPLES.md (813) + GREEK_NUMBERS.md (202)

yaml-scalars:
    - literal-clip: '|'
    - literal-strip: |-
    - literal-keep: |+
    - folded-clip: '>'
    - folded-strip: >-
    - folded-keep: >+
    - indent-indicator: '|2 , >1-'

depth-mechanism:
    > Bracket label [!IMPORTANT]/[!CAUTION]/[!TIP] = kind/severity.
    > Quote depth >/>>/>>> = relation: peer vs child vs grandchild.
    > Sequential [!A] then [!B] = independent peers.
    > Nested >> [!B] inside > [!A] = B subordinate refinement.
    > Triple >>> [!C] = most specific actionable detail.
    nt-mapping:
        > First > + space = string tag, stripped by pretty-print.
        > Remaining > in content = visual depth.
        > Line '> > [!IMPORTANT]' renders '> [!IMPORTANT]'.

greek:
    core-1-12: mono di tri tetra penta hexa hepta octa ennea deca hendeca dodeca
    teens: triskaideca tetrakaideca pentakaideca hexakaideca heptakaideca octakaideca enneakaideca
    tens: icosa triaconta tetraconta pentaconta hexaconta heptaconta octaconta enneaconta
    note: ordinals via lib/ordinals.mjs before .md only on multi-file runs
